  "bandsNote": "drafted 2026-10-12 by scripts/bands.mjs off the released default page (/): each kept band that is not a picture wears the system's ground (src/bands.mjs), its words keep their colours; 14/10/2026 (visual review, /index.php/our-projects and /index.php/pages/joomla-content/all-categories): (1) the inner page-title band (.ja-masthead.has-bg) is the nebula photo faded at its bottom into the page by a ::before gradient drawn in the page colour, under a cyan gradient title and a white subtitle; under a light system the fade went to white right under the words (title about 1.3:1, subtitle gone). It is a kept picture band now: the fade keeps the template’s black and the words their colours, as on the dark page they were drawn for; (2) each project card (.view-project) lays its title and type in the template’s white over its photo (.intro-wrap, absolute); the words followed the page text, dark on the dark car and room photos under light systems. Each card is a kept picture band now, its words keep their white. The drafted pill .badge is kept. 15/10/2026: (3) the header (#t3-header, root false) has no ground of its own either: it lies over the hero's nebula photo (keepNote), yet its accent link (.item-129 a, 'Start a Project', the template's pale #ffd97b) was made readable on the band's recorded #000000, where a mid accent already reaches 4.5:1; on the photo's dark violet (#271225) it read 3.80-4.40:1 (Notion #0075de, Figma #625ffc, Voiceflow #437ce8 at 1440, v10). The header is a picture band like the hero it lies over: its accent is judged where the photo runs 30% toward its words, a pale tint of the system's accent as the template's own pale yellow (Notion #94c5f1); its .t3-wrapper paint (a ground, which a picture band keeps) named nothing inside the header",
